[C]Suffering You traded blood for [D]me
[C]My heart will sing the deepest praise my [D]lips rejoice my [G/B]hands will raise
[C]For the death that brought me into [D]life

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
[C]All for [D]love
My [G/B]Jesus You gave [C]all for [D]love
I am [G/B]standing in the [C]wonder [D]of
Your great [C]love [D]

